FACTS: list[str] = [
    "ByteSizedChef is a premium meal kit delivery service that sends pre-portioned, chef-designed ingredients directly to your doorstep weekly.",
    "The standard subscription plan costs $12.99 per serving, while the family plan offers a discounted rate of $10.50 per serving for 4 or more people.",
    "All ByteSizedChef ingredients are sourced from organic, certified sustainable local farms and arrive in 100% recyclable, temperature-controlled boxes.",
    "Subscribers must select their weekly recipes through the mobile app or website by Wednesday at 11:59 PM EST for the following week's delivery.",
    "Deliveries are made every Sunday and Monday between 8:00 AM and 5:00 PM local time. You do not need to be home to sign for the delivery.",
    "The service caters to multiple dietary preferences, including strict Vegan, Keto, Paleo, Gluten-Free, and low-sodium diets, visible via menu tags.",
    "Each box includes detailed, step-by-step recipe cards with QR codes linking to 60-second video tutorials for every culinary technique used.",
    "The average preparation and cooking time for a ByteSizedChef meal is between 20 to 35 minutes, requiring only basic kitchen tools like a pan and knife.",
    "If an ingredient arrives damaged or missing, customers can log into the app support tab to receive an instant prorated refund or account credit.",
    "You can pause, skip a week, or cancel your subscription at any time without penalties, provided changes are made before the Wednesday deadline.",
    "Refunds for damaged goods are processed immediately to the original payment method but may take 3 to 5 business days to appear on your bank statement.",
    "Subscribers who cancel their account after the Wednesday 11:59 PM deadline will still receive and be billed for that week's upcoming box, with the cancellation taking effect the following week.",
    "Late delivery refund policy: If a box arrives more than 4 hours past the designated delivery window, customers are eligible for a 50% discount credit on their next order.",
    "Subscriptions can only be canceled through the account settings portal on the official website or mobile app; customer service agents cannot process cancellations via email or phone."
];